    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Can and have to",
     "texto": [
      "**Mogę** means «I can» and **muszę**, «I have to»; both are followed by an infinitive.",
      "**Nie mogę przyjść** expresses that you can't come; it is a common way to politely decline an invitation."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Suggesting another time",
     "texto": [
      "**Szkoda** means «what a shame».",
      "**Może później?** («Maybe later?») lets you suggest another time without turning the invitation down bluntly."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
